{"sid": "d9251f5f-fce2-4e41-9c13-8d46e21f8c66", "uid": "ea6b6f31-4e76-4a88-aaae-39fec360ad03", "seq": 19, "ts": 1791800251.5677664, "plan_id": null, "event": {"type": "agent_reply", "content": "Importing catalogue data from a website does not require model changes—data records live in the database, not in project files. To populate the catalogue, use the sample-data-generator: open the **surz_product** screen and import product records from https://surzion.com/, which will also populate related categories and images if they are referenced in the source data. Alternatively, if the website data is not directly accessible via API, export it to CSV/Excel first, then import that file.", "seq": 19}}
